1
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,336
=Episode 20=

2
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:09,680
So...

3
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,360
you're the one at the end of
that life-or-death tribulation

4
00:00:12,879 --> 00:00:14,279
you told me about.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,359
I want to take Jin Yunlie back.

6
00:00:19,279 --> 00:00:20,880
Netherworld Sovereign,

7
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,600
does your word still stand?

8
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:30,000
Xi Yuan.

9
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,359
No matter who I am,

10
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,960
I'm still Shisi.

11
00:00:34,559 --> 00:00:35,359
Between us,

12
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,719
there's no need for such formality.

13
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:40,240
All right.

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,719
For old times' sake,

15
00:00:43,479 --> 00:00:44,880
I hope you'll keep your word.

16
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:06,039
My past,

17
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:07,920
my present,

18
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,280
and my future...

19
00:01:09,759 --> 00:01:11,400
You can have it all. Is that enough?

20
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,640
Why would you go this far?

21
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:18,120
Without a future,

22
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,400
you'll die soon.

23
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:22,079
I just want to take him with me.

24
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,359
Is it worth it?

25
00:01:30,879 --> 00:01:32,640
I'm doing this willingly.

26
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,760
Very well.

27
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,439
Jin Yunlie.

28
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:10,680
Take him with you.

29
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,560
Let's go.

30
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,280
Xi Yuan.

31
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,639
Come back!

32
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:38,560
My Spiritual Power is giving out!

33
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,759
Jin Yunlie.

34
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,360
You're awake.

35
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,039
Xi Yuan.

36
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,039
Yunlie.

37
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,319
You're both awake.

38
00:03:03,904 --> 00:03:07,020
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

39
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:11,000
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

40
00:03:18,608 --> 00:03:21,600
♪Lost in the gaps where rain
slips through, life's a fleeting line♪

41
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:24,432
♪Hard to forget the losses of the past♪

42
00:03:25,472 --> 00:03:30,860
♪Love may yet go on,
making memories come alive♪

43
00:03:32,384 --> 00:03:35,280
♪The wind hasn't risen tonight.
Missing you might be an illness♪

44
00:03:35,888 --> 00:03:38,300
♪The long misty rain scatters in haste♪

45
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:44,060
♪Letting go may be love's last line♪

46
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:48,928
♪Wind and moon draw me into longing,
how can I bear a love unpledged?♪

47
00:03:48,976 --> 00:03:52,190
♪Bridal splendor, a lifetime of love,
all of it was only a dream♪

48
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:55,440
♪My beauty fades, my longing breaks,
my ink runs red and blurs with tears♪

49
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:58,416
♪Over three lives, love waxes and wanes,
love reveals itself without a word♪

50
00:03:59,312 --> 00:04:02,080
♪Who can forget the dreams
once held and lost♪

51
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:05,840
♪Petals on your shoulder are your charm♪

52
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:08,864
♪For whom does the wind shift so quiet♪

53
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,090
♪That is my silent confession in bloom♪

54
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:15,370
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

55
00:04:15,872 --> 00:04:18,990
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

56
00:04:20,039 --> 00:04:21,039
(Without a future,)

57
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:23,759
(you'll die soon.)

58
00:04:26,272 --> 00:04:29,150
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

59
00:04:29,664 --> 00:04:33,050
♪Rouge sachets and jade towers
can't match your dance in the light♪

60
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:39,070
♪Once the heart knows love's design,
it's you I seek, and intertwine♪

61
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,120
Is it worth it?

62
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,000
You restored her future

63
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,040
by sacrificing your own.

64
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:54,199
Very well.

65
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,920
Take him with you.

66
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,160
Our plan depended

67
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:11,879
on keeping Xi Yuan safe.

68
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,560
Didn't it?

69
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,360
What about you?

70
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,480
Shisi.

71
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,000
Mortal or deity,

72
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,199
without a future,

73
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,959
you'll eventually fade away.

74
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:26,360
It's only a matter of when.

75
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,959
I've lived for countless millennia.

76
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,040
That's long enough.

77
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,800
No one

78
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,560
thinks they've lived too long.

79
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:42,720
Anyway,

80
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:44,319
don't tell Xi Yuan

81
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,360
about this yet.

82
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:17,279
Bye, Xi Yuan! Bye!

83
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:18,360
Goodbye, Xi Yuan!

84
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,240
Take care, Xi Yuan!

85
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,120
Yunlie.

86
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:30,240
I'm about to head back to Xuanhan.

87
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:33,560
The incident in Zhongtu involves
the Demon Lord.

88
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:35,879
I must return to Huyun at once
and strengthen its defenses.

89
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,759
So this time,

90
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,279
I can't go back to Xuanhan with you.

91
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:40,720
Yunlie.

92
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:41,480
I understand.

93
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,439
When you and Xi Yuan are done,

94
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,959
come visit me in Xuanhan.

95
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,600
- Of course.
- Of course.

96
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:48,720
Bye.

97
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:56,439
How did you and
the Netherworld Sovereign...?

98
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,000
Oh.

99
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,319
Shisi and I go way back.

100
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:01,879
I'm the reincarnation
of the Phoenix Deity.

101
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,120
We're very close.

102
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:06,040
I put in a good word for us,

103
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,120
and he let us go.

104
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:08,759
The Phoenix Deity?

105
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:11,000
It's a long story.

106
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,319
I'll tell you all about it later.

107
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:12,839
Let's go.

108
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:14,720
Hey.

109
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,000
- Your Highness.
- You're back.

110
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,560
Your Highness.

111
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,199
Where is Miss Xi Yuan?

112
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,759
The journey wore her out.

113
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,240
She fell asleep immediately.

114
00:08:34,319 --> 00:08:34,959
Kui Mulang.

115
00:08:35,439 --> 00:08:37,160
Go find Huyun's Priestly Order.

116
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:39,320
Have them place a Confinement Seal

117
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:40,639
above Huyun Imperial Palace,

118
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,799
one that can trap anyone from Huangyan.

119
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,840
Your Highness.

120
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:47,080
Are you planning to imprison
Miss Xi Yuan in the palace?

121
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,960
Given Xi Yuan's special status,

122
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,440
I can't let her be abducted again

123
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:53,720
and put in danger like in Zhongtu.

124
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:54,320
Understood.

125
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,600
One more thing.

126
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:58,080
While I was away from the palace,

127
00:08:58,799 --> 00:08:59,720
did anything unusual happen?

128
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,320
Your Highness,

129
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:01,879
everything has been normal lately.

130
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,720
Actually, Your Highness,

131
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:06,480
our informants reported

132
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,000
that His Majesty has been

133
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,600
talking to himself in his chambers.

134
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,399
They were too far away

135
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,879
to hear what he was saying.

136
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:14,720
(Your father)

137
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,759
(may have fallen into
demonic corruption)

138
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:17,480
(and lost all reason and humanity.)

139
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,639
I'm going to the Archive Pavilion.

140
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:25,159
Spirit from afar, heed my call!

141
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,200
Dead soul,

142
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:27,919
come forth at once!

143
00:09:35,660 --> 00:09:37,200
(A fragment of Chi Yuan's soul.)

144
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:41,840
So...

145
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,360
one soul can truly hold two spirits.

146
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,519
Hmph.

147
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,000
Two spirits in one body?

148
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,480
She stole my body from me!

149
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,960
Ever since

150
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:55,679
that vile woman seized my body,

151
00:09:56,399 --> 00:09:59,480
I've barely survived
in a corner of the Spirit Core.

152
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,679
I suppose, you wouldn't

153
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:04,279
have revived me for nothing, would you?

154
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,320
Tell me.

155
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,840
What are you after?

156
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,320
My face...

157
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:13,919
This isn't my face!

158
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:18,200
Don't be so impatient.

159
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,840
The Demon Lord said

160
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,200
this woman

161
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,600
looks just like you did
in your past life.

162
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:26,240
But now...

163
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:39,960
Xi Yuan.

164
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,120
You wretched woman!

165
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:45,639
Now you're even trying
to steal Chi Li from me!

166
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,600
Even cutting you into pieces

167
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,399
wouldn't ease my rage.

168
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:58,928
(Season Finale)

169
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:07,760
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

170
00:11:08,544 --> 00:11:14,000
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

171
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:21,040
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

172
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:28,080
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
